---
// Holo's three columns of the Me and community pages, 460, 310 and 160 wide
// with 8px between the boxes, in flexbox at 16/11: each column grows in Holo's
// proportion of the page, 12px apart, and its boxes stand 10px apart. A tablet
// shows two columns, the third under the second; a phone one column.
---

<div class="flex flex-col gap-2.5 md:flex-row md:items-start md:gap-3">
  <div class="flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-2.5 md:grow-[452] md:basis-0">
    <slot />
  </div>
  <div class="flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-2.5 md:grow-[302] md:basis-0 lg:grow-[474] lg:flex-row lg:items-start lg:gap-3">
    <div class="flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-2.5 lg:grow-[302] lg:basis-0">
      <slot name="second" />
    </div>
    <div class="flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-2.5 lg:grow-[160] lg:basis-0">
      <slot name="third" />
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
